        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-15T20:55:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You probably want to print a message here for logging.\n\nDo we clear the value once we trigger a slow charge or keep using it (charge-\u003edischarge-\u003e...)? What\u0027s the condition for clear?",
      "revId": "110532fa665f8a5a0b28a59aed16cc56f4e3dc30",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2c6d1da4_3dd1ed14",
        "filename": "common/charge_state_v2.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 1464,
      "author": {
        "id": 1563627
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-16T10:30:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we can clear it because when this function is checked again, it will stop slow charging if the `current_limit_value` has been reset. The current limit is reset when slow charging is switched to fast charging or when adaptive charging is stopped (ie. on AC disconnect, when battery is fully charged). When holding charge ~100% the charge-discharge cycle that happens already uses a very low current below the typical 0.1C value.",
      "parentUuid": "19eaae18_0210a771",
      "revId": "110532fa665f8a5a0b28a59aed16cc56f4e3dc30",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e0478b19_a720c27a",
        "filename": "common/charge_state_v2.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 1464,
      "author": {
        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-16T17:25:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e when adaptive charging is stopped (ie. on AC disconnect\n\nDo we also do this in shutdown? How do we reset slow charge?",
      "parentUuid": "2c6d1da4_3dd1ed14",
      "revId": "110532fa665f8a5a0b28a59aed16cc56f4e3dc30",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "dd0d4df0_4c7bd118",
        "filename": "common/charge_state_v2.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 1464,
