        "id": 1563627
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-02-17T05:41:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently adaptive charging is stopped on shutdown and the charge limit is reset at that point.",
      "parentUuid": "e0478b19_a720c27a",
      "revId": "110532fa665f8a5a0b28a59aed16cc56f4e3dc30",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
