      "message": "Currently any limit is accepted. This behaviour matches the current behaviour of the `chargecurrentlimit` command, which accepts any limit.\n\nThe limit is treated as an upper bound for the current, so high values don\u0027t present a problem (e.g., INT_MAX is used in the existing code to mean \"no limit\".)",
